extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLVvbI4jdQAQ7kNvwE7j_CS&_nc_oc=AdqFNcLHxfnQrIRwC28ueiYnU2g09qgg77wd1Ea4Ur6HAMRq0q8GvIwCZuia6g0oMuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQObXNKwtyHife1kq8l6AeCCYjplsAY05JlRdmu67P-NaQ&oe=6ADCCCD6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kiVEN6vopPoQ7kNvwE6QCR2&_nc_oc=AdqhR-H1jTxKkNWHeB7XiB8B4ORZGBuCm-9OyzIpyZtAmox5O7uhztGwrLiVJ9rx_Mg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN7BIReU7K4WV9thfHgSa6F10FKXlsA6mXve2cGWQQnQw&oe=6ADCD422"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P3ZM-nmNhDYQ7kNvwHLfuI_&_nc_oc=AdrDJ9qCkUW_9g_Igxzw6XNPvNmapwF4gSIfWtIc4Hzr-FKY8CMUfdnfEg3fpFfhnFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOaXdJH8cXqBHN62T4VjjdUyhqiZ9gg3LB_-z0COCbn_A&oe=6ADCA3D9"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":